---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { productMetadata } from '../../lib/product';
---
<Layout title="Your Round Intelligence — State of Stick Golf" description="Deterministic, provenance-aware golf intelligence for your rounds, league, and next practice focus." eyebrow="STATE OF STICK GOLF INTELLIGENCE">
  <section class="page shell"><div class="intelligence-hero"><div><div class="eyebrow">{productMetadata.productName} · {productMetadata.intelligenceLayer}</div><h1>See what your game is telling you.</h1><p>Every round makes the network smarter—while official scores, league standings, and verification stay in their authoritative records.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="/passport/">Open your passport ↗</a><a class="button secondary" href="/league/anywhere/">Climb your league</a></div></div><div class="intelligence-orb"><span>ROUND</span><b>+</b><span>CONTEXT</span><b>+</b><span>PROGRESS</span></div></div>
    <div class="intelligence-grid"><article class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">YOUR ROUND INTELLIGENCE</div><h2>Your next practice focus</h2><p class="intelligence-lead">Your data suggests focusing on Hole 07 at Cedar Ridge, based on the highest average recorded score in the available sample.</p><small class="advisory-label">ADVISORY · NOT AN OFFICIAL HANDICAP CALCULATION</small><div class="source-facts"><span><b>Source fact</b>Hole 07 recorded scores: 5, 6, 5</span><span><b>Confidence</b>Medium · 3 recorded rounds</span><span><b>Generated</b>Rules engine · deterministic-v1</span></div></article><article class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">PLAYER TRENDS</div><h2>Progress you can feel.</h2><div class="intelligence-stat"><b>3</b><span>verified rounds</span></div><div class="intelligence-stat"><b>47</b><span>courses in your passport history</span></div><p class="panel-copy">Based on your recorded rounds, your recent scoring trend is steady. Add more comparable rounds to sharpen the signal.</p></article><article class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">SAFE ASSISTANT</div><h2>Ask about your own rounds.</h2><p class="panel-copy">Questions are answered only from authorized golf records. The assistant will qualify or refuse private-player, medical, gambling, unsupported live-condition, and unverified-official questions.</p><div class="assistant-example">“Where am I losing the most strokes?”<br /><span>Source facts attached · advisory interpretation</span></div></article><article class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">PROVENANCE</div><h2>Useful, with receipts.</h2><p class="panel-copy">Every insight shows the source facts used, confidence, timestamp, rule version, and whether it is verified or advisory.</p><div class="provenance-row"><i></i><span>Source facts</span><i></i><span>Interpretation</span><i></i><span>Confidence</span></div></article></div>
    <div class="source-note"><strong>INTELLIGENCE BOUNDARY</strong><span>State of Stick Golf Intelligence can explain recorded facts, but it never invents official scores, handicap indexes, yardage, course conditions, player identity, verification status, league standings, or financial outcomes.</span></div>
  </section>
</Layout>
